notes.content:
Hello fans of horror games!
My game "Grandmother" has been on Steam for a month and it's time to update it.
I listened to your feedback, thank you. Every opinion is important to me!
I want to tell you about the changelog:
-Significantly reduced the price of the game;
-Optimized the main character's candle (more realistic prevention of hand passing through objects);
-Improving the consecration in the mansion;
-Added new visual and sound effects for the second ending;
-Optimized reflections on glass materials;
-Changes to the secret room;
-Optimized sounds of steps, falling objects and doors;
-Fixed a bug with a door in the basement;
-Changed the plot script (now you can always take the ashes).
I hope you enjoy the update. Thanks!
JUNGLE.
